        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG3004 Stainless Steel Mortise Lock Entry Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rectangular Stainless Steel Mortise Lock Entry Handleset has a modern look that makes it a great addition to contemporary builds. This mortise handleset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches up to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Stainless Steel Mortise Lock Entry Handleset is available with your choice of stainless steel interior trim lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>All Stainless Steel Trim:</b> Extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for door hardware. It needs little looking after and does not degrade in appearance or function with use.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Mortise Lockcase:</b> Heavy gauge plated steel UL & ULC listed for custom residential, high traffic commercial, institutional and industrial uses where durability and security are of the greatest concern.  UL-listed for 3 hours. UL label stamped on front (ULC available) UL sticker on case.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/rectangular-stainless-steel-dummy-handleset-ahi-sig3004d\"><b>SIG3004D Stainless Steel Dummy Handleset</b></a> for the inactive door on a French Door Set (Double Doors).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the AHI SIG3004 Mortise Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>3 Hour fire rated</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: Brass anti-friction type</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Forged brass with hardened steel inserts</li>\r\n<li>Package includes: Interior and Exterior plates, Interior Trim, American Mortise box, Schlage Cylinder.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AHI SIG3004 Rectangular Stainless Steel Mortise Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 17-1/4\" (438 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/8\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\" (280 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-3/8\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Minimum thickness, optional up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" (70mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Faceplate: 1-1/4\" Stainless steel</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: Brass anti-friction type</li>\r\n<li>Strike plate: Stainless steel ANSI standard 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x 1-1/8\" lip to center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG3004.pdf?v=1691093349\"><b>AHI SIG3004 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. </i>\r\n</p>",
